# E §10 (a projection: its holder and day t, the start balance, the movements counted, those left out) and L §5.14.1
# (low(x, a .. b) from t = min(bal(x, d) from t for d in a .. b); bal(x, d) from t starts from x's balance at the
# start of t): windows that reach the run's last day, which is also the last day of the month index. Ten rents of
# 10.00 PLN are booked before 2026-11-01, so the start is 500.00 - 100.00 = 400.00 PLN; the rents of 2026-11-01 and
# 2026-12-01 bring it to 380.00 PLN, the lowest; from 2026-12-31 the balance is 380.00 PLN. room[2026-12] reads
# the projection from 2026-12-01 to the last day: 380.00 PLN. (A household text's explain of such a def crashed; the
# crash's cause is the printer's, test E10_explain_cause_order; this one guards the run's end.)
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-18
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "synthetic"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

index mon = month 2026-01..2026-12

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input amt: money PLN
input last_day: date

move rent[m in mon]: transfers
  on start_of(m)
  leg cash from konto to world amount amt

def room[m in mon]: money PLN = low(konto, start_of(m) .. last_day) from start_of(m)

ask e: explain low(konto, 2026-11-01 .. 2026-12-31) from 2026-11-01
ask e2: explain bal(konto, 2026-12-31) from 2026-12-31
ask r: room[2026-12]

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 10.00 PLN
  last_day = 2026-12-31
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
=== expect
e: 380.00 PLN
  projection of konto (PLN) from 2026-11-01, lowest end-of-day balance on 2026-11-01 .. 2026-12-31
  holder: ask e (an ask line leaves out nothing, L §5.14.1)
  clauses: windows none, random none, without uncertain
  start: 400.00 PLN at the start of 2026-11-01
  counted:
    2026-11-01:
      rent[2026-11].cash (plan): -10.00 PLN
    2026-12-01:
      rent[2026-12].cash (plan): -10.00 PLN
  left out: none
  lowest: 380.00 PLN at the end of 2026-12-01
...
e2: 380.00 PLN
  projection of konto (PLN) from 2026-12-31 to the end of 2026-12-31
...
r: 380.00 PLN
...
